                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='7000' id='182' type-v2='empty' w='98858' x='571' y='8083'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='60000' id='332' type-v2='text' w='92432' x='3770' y='15083'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='14'>Purpose</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>This dashboard was designed to visually explore gender pay gap, fair pay and equal pay across DHSE. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>It was created on the request of Total Rewards team, which is the only one having direct access to it.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>Headcount by Gender and Gender Pay Gap</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report shows the gender pay gap and headcount by gender on different levels of granularity (overall, track and level).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>Fair Pay</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report shows the gender pay gap at the job profile granularity. The overall pay gap might be skewed as an indicator because of different ratios of male employees and female employees within different job profiles.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>Equal Pay Index</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report shows a comparison of the average female salary and/or LTIP with regards to the overall average salary and/or LTIP.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='14'>Objectives</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>This dashboard answers the following questions:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>1. How many male and female employees are there at DHSE?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>2. What is the gender pay gap?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>3. How many male and female employees move to M track (%)?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>4. How many male and female employees are in each level (%)?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>5. What is the gender pay gap at each level?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>6. What is the comp ratio for male and female employees?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>7. How many female and male employees are in each pay quartile (%)?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>8. What is the gender pay gap for each job profile?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>9. What is the equal pay index on base salary for each level?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>10. What is the equal pay index on base salary in Tech and in Non-Tech?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>11. What is the equal pay index on LTI for each level and by tech-nontech?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>12. What is the equal pay index on LTI in Tech and in Non-Tech?</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='15667' id='333' type-v2='empty' w='92432' x='3770' y='75083'>
