                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report shows the gender pay gap and headcount by gender on different levels of granularity (overall, track and level).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>Fair Pay</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report shows the gender pay gap at the job profile granularity. The overall pay gap might be skewed as an indicator because of different ratios of male employees and female employees within different job profiles.</run>
