                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report shows a comparison of the average female salary and/or LTIP with regards to the overall average salary and/or LTIP.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='14'>Objectives</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>This dashboard answers the following questions:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>1. How many male and female employees are there at DHSE?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
